  "title": "Intern Spotlight: Skyler Cook",
  "summary": "We are excited to highlight one of our talented Engineering Interns from our Logan, UT facility, Skyler Cook. Skylar started in 2024 with our Summer Internship Program. He enjoyed the experience and decided to continue his journey with us through our Co-Op program while he attended school. Skylar is making remarkable strides during his internship AND co-op.1. What school do you attend, and what is your major?I attend Utah State University, and I am majoring in Electrical Engineering.",
